  "body": "Back in 2018 I worked on https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/10891 and I didn't really question whether this is something we wanted to change, but both Chrome and Safari getting away with not passing on the document encoding (and thus using UTF-8) makes me wonder if we should just align on that instead as it's slightly simpler and requires less engines to change.\r\n\r\n@valenting thoughts?\r\n\r\nRelated bugs:\r\n\r\n* https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=185419\r\n* https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=840760",
